<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="th"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - MindCare Admin</title><%- include('../partials/head') %><style>.profile-shell{max-width:760px;margin:0;width:100%}.profile-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.06)}.profile-section{padding:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9}.profile-section:last-child{border-bottom:none}.section-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin:0 0 14px}.inp{width:100%;padding:9px 12px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:#334155;outline:none;font-family:inherit;box-sizing:border-box;background:#fff}.inp:focus{border-color:#2dd4b4;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(45,212,180,.15)}.inp[readonly]{background:#f8fafc;color:#64748b;cursor:not-allowed}.lbl{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:5px}.check-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.check-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:#334155;background:#fff;transition:all .15s}.check-card:hover{border-color:#2dd4b4;background:#ecfdf9}.check-card input{accent-color:#05967e}.check-flag{width:24px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(148,163,184,.35)}.act-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:all .15s;text-decoration:none}.login-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start}.password-wrap{position:relative}.password-wrap .inp{padding-right:44px}.password-toggle{position:absolute;right:8px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:30px;height:30px;border:0;background:transparent;color:#94a3b8;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer}.password-toggle:hover{background:#f1f5f9;color:#05967e}.ab-primary{background:#05967e;color:#fff}.ab-primary:hover{background:#067866}.ab-secondary{background:#fff;color:#05967e;border:1px solid #a0f3e1}.ab-secondary:hover{background:#ecfdf9}@media(max-width:768px){.admin-main{margin-left:0!important}.profile-grid,.login-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.check-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body style="background:#f8fafc;margin:0;"><%- include('../partials/admin-sidebar') %><div class="admin-main" style="margin-left:256px;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;"><div style="height:56px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;padding:0 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;"><h1 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;margin:0;"><%= title %></h1><span style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;"><%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('th-TH',{year:'numeric',month:'long',day:'numeric'}) %></span></div><main style="padding:24px;"><div class="profile-shell"><% if (session && session.userType === 'counselor') { %><%- include('../partials/counselor-welcome-banner') %><% } %><% if (query.updated) { %><div style="margin-bottom:16px;padding:12px 16px;background:#ecfdf9;border:1px solid #a0f3e1;border-radius:12px;color:#065f46;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><i data-lucide="check-circle" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i> อัปเดตข้อมูลผู้ใช้สำเร็จ</div><% } %><form class="profile-card" method="POST" action="/admin/profile" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-counselor-profile-form="true"><div style="padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0fb89a,#06b6d4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;"><i data-lucide="user-cog" style="width:18px;height:18px;"></i></div><div><h2 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#1e293b;margin:0;">แก้ไขข้อมูลผู้ใช้</h2><p style="font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin:3px 0 0;">แก้ไขข้อมูลโปรไฟล์นักจิตวิทยาให้คำปรึกษาของคุณ</p></div></div><button type="submit" class="act-btn ab-primary"><i data-lucide="save" style="width:14px;height:14px;"></i> บันทึกการแก้ไข</button></div><div class="profile-section"><p class="section-title">รูปถ่าย</p><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;"><div id="photo-preview" style="width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2dd4b4,#06b6d4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><% if (counselor.photo) { %><img id="photo-img" src="<%= counselor.photo %>" alt="<%= counselor.name %>" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"><span id="photo-initials" style="display:none;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;"><%= counselor.avatar || '?' %></span><% } else { %><img id="photo-img" src="" alt="" style="display:none;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"><span id="photo-initials" style="color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;"><%= counselor.avatar || '?' %></span><% } %></div><div style="flex:1;min-width:0;"><label class="lbl" for="f_photo">เลือกรูปถ่าย</label><input type="file" name="photo" id="f_photo" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" class="inp" style="padding:6px;" onchange="previewPhoto(this)"><p style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin:4px 0 0;">JPG, PNG, WEBP</p></div></div></div><div class="profile-section"><p class="section-title">ข้อมูลส่วนตัว</p><div style="display:grid;gap:12px;"><div><label class="lbl" for="f_name">ชื่อ-นามสกุล *</label><input type="text" name="name" id="f_name" class="inp" required value="<%= counselor.name || '' %>"></div><div class="profile-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;"><div><label class="lbl" for="f_title">ตำแหน่ง / คุณวุฒิ *</label><input type="text" name="title" id="f_title" class="inp" required value="<%= counselor.title || '' %>"></div><div><label class="lbl" for="f_phone">เบอร์โทรศัพท์</label><input type="tel" name="phone" id="f_phone" class="inp" value="<%= counselor.phone || '' %>"></div></div><div><label class="lbl" for="f_email">อีเมล *</label><input type="email" name="email" id="f_email" class="inp" required value="<%= counselor.email || '' %>"></div><div><label class="lbl" for="f_bio">ประวัติย่อ</label><textarea name="bio" id="f_bio" rows="3" class="inp" style="resize:none;"><%= counselor.bio || '' %></textarea></div></div></div><div class="profile-section"><p class="section-title">ความเชี่ยวชาญ</p><div style="display:grid;gap:12px;"><div><label class="lbl" for="f_specialties">ความเชี่ยวชาญ<span style="font-weight:400;color:#94a3b8;">(คั่นด้วยจุลภาค)</span></label><input type="text" name="specialties" id="f_specialties" class="inp" value="<%= (counselor.specialties || []).join(', ') %>"></div><div><label class="lbl">ภาษาที่สื่อสารได้</label><% const langs = (counselor.languages || []).map(l => String(l).toLowerCase()) %><div class="check-grid" id="f_languages"><label class="check-card"><input type="checkbox" name="languages" value="ไทย" data-lang="thai" <%= langs.includes('thai') || langs.includes('th') || langs.includes('ไทย') ? 'checked' : '' %>><svg class="check-flag" viewBox="0 0 24 18" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="24" height="18" fill="#da291c"></rect><rect y="3" width="24" height="12" fill="#fff"></rect><rect y="6" width="24" height="6" fill="#2d2a4a"></rect></svg><span>ไทย</span></label><label class="check-card"><input type="checkbox" name="languages" value="อังกฤษ" data-lang="english" <%= langs.includes('english') || langs.includes('en') || langs.includes('อังกฤษ') ? 'checked' : '' %>><svg class="check-flag" viewBox="0 0 60 36" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="60" height="36" fill="#012169"></rect><path d="M0 0l60 36M60 0L0 36" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="7"></path><path d="M0 0l60 36M60 0L0 36" stroke="#c8102e" stroke-width="4"></path><path d="M30 0v36M0 18h60" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="12"></path><path d="M30 0v36M0 18h60" stroke="#c8102e" stroke-width="7"></path></svg><span>อังกฤษ</span></label></div></div></div></div><div class="profile-section"><p class="section-title">Duration</p><label class="lbl" for="f_sessionDuration">ระยะเวลา</label><select name="sessionDuration" id="f_sessionDuration" class="inp"><% ;[30,45,60,90].forEach(duration => { %><option value="<%= duration %>" <%= Number(counselor.sessionDuration || 60) === duration ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= duration %> นาที</option><% }) %></select></div><div class="profile-section"><p class="section-title">ข้อมูลการเข้าสู่ระบบ</p><div class="login-grid"><div><label class="lbl" for="f_username_display">ชื่อผู้ใช้</label><input type="text" id="f_username_display" class="inp" value="<%= counselor.username || '-' %>" readonly aria-readonly="true" data-readonly-username="true"><p style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin:7px 0 0;">ชื่อผู้ใช้ใช้สำหรับเข้าสู่ระบบ จึงแสดงให้เห็นเท่านั้นและไม่สามารถแก้ไขได้จากหน้านี้</p></div><div><label class="lbl" for="f_password">รหัสผ่านใหม่</label><div class="password-wrap"><input type="password" name="password" id="f_password" class="inp" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="ปล่อยว่างถ้าไม่ต้องการเปลี่ยน"><button type="button" class="password-toggle" data-password-toggle="true" aria-label="Show password" aria-pressed="false" onclick="togglePasswordVisibility(this)"><i data-lucide="eye" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></button></div><p style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin:7px 0 0;">กรอกเฉพาะเมื่อต้องการเปลี่ยนรหัสผ่าน หากไม่กรอกจะใช้รหัสผ่านเดิม</p></div></div></div><div style="padding:16px 20px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;"><a href="/admin" class="act-btn ab-secondary">ยกเลิก</a><button type="submit" class="act-btn ab-primary"><i data-lucide="save" style="width:14px;height:14px;"></i> บันทึกการแก้ไข</button></div></form></div></main></div><script>function previewPhoto(input){if(input.files&&input.files[0]){const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=e=>{document.getElementById('photo-img').src=e.target.result;document.getElementById('photo-img').style.display='block';document.getElementById('photo-initials').style.display='none'};reader.readAsDataURL(input.files[0])}}function togglePasswordVisibility(button){const input=document.getElementById('f_password');const showing=input.type==='text';input.type=showing?'password':'text';button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(!showing));button.setAttribute('aria-label',showing?'Show password':'Hide password');button.innerHTML=`<i data-lucide="${showing?'eye':'eye-off'}" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i>`;lucide.createIcons()}lucide.createIcons()</script></body></html>